.SH "struct pdg::SpriteTriggerEvent"
.PP 
Payload for an authored Spriter trigger delivered as eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\&. 

The common JavaScript payload contains:

.PP
Field  Meaning  \fRemitter\fP  Event emitter delivering the notification  \fReventType\fP  \fBpdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\fP  \fRactingSprite\fP  Sprite whose animation crossed the trigger  \fRinLayer\fP  SpriteLayer containing that Sprite  \fRtriggerName\fP  Authored eventline name  \fRclipName\fP  Clip containing the eventline key  \fRentityName\fP  Spriter entity containing the clip  \fRtimeSeconds\fP  Authored key position from clip start, in floating-point seconds  \fRoffsetSeconds\fP  Occurrence offset from the start of the update, in floating-point seconds  

.PP
Subscribe by event type and inspect \fRtriggerName\fP to distinguish authored triggers\&. An \fRaction\fP field is not a portable trigger discriminator\&. The native compatibility field \fRframeTime\fP uses integer milliseconds and is omitted from JavaScript\&. The native event ID is currently exposed by the browser bridge but not the V8/JavaScriptCore bridges\&.

.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBpdg::Sprite::enableSpriterEvents\fP 

.PP
\fBpdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\fP 

.PP
\fBAuthored Spriter triggers\fP 
.RE
.PP

.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "enableSpriterEvents (boolean enable = \fRtrue\fP)"

.PP
Enable or disable authored Spriter trigger notifications for this \fBSprite\fP\&. Register an \fBIEventHandler\fP for \fBpdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\fP to receive a \fBpdg::SpriteTriggerEvent\fP payload\&. This flag does not gate blend-completion notifications\&. See \fBAuthored Spriter triggers\fP for delivery and timing rules\&. 
.SS "\fBIEventHandler\fP onAnimationBlendComplete (function func)"

.PP
Register a callback function to be called when an animation blend or transition completes\&. Filters \fBpdg::eventType_SpriteAnimate\fP for \fBpdg::action_AnimationBlendComplete\fP\&. The callback receives a \fBpdg::SpriteAnimateEvent\fP\&. Covers \fBpdg::Sprite::blendToAnimation()\fP and \fBpdg::Sprite::transitionToAnimation()\fP; enabling authored triggers is independent\&. 
.SH "Variable Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "const action_AnimationBlendComplete = 15"

.PP
eventType_SpriteAnimate action: a Spriter animation blend completed\&. Delivered as \fBpdg::eventType_SpriteAnimate\fP with a \fBpdg::SpriteAnimateEvent\fP payload when \fBpdg::Sprite::blendToAnimation()\fP or \fBpdg::Sprite::transitionToAnimation()\fP completes\&. Register with \fBpdg::Sprite::onAnimationBlendComplete()\fP to receive only this action\&. Authored-trigger enablement does not control blend-completion events\&.

.PP
